# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# This file is kept for backwards compatibility only.
# As of v2.0, a single root-level .env file powers BOTH backend and frontend.
#
# Vite is configured with envDir: "../" so it reads from the project root.
# Please copy the root .env.example instead:
#
#   cp ../.env.example ../.env
#
# All VITE_-prefixed variables from the root .env are available to the frontend.
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
